y separate the IoT and cybersecurity business units, rightsizing our operations, and driving efficiencies in the process.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/12/20/blackberry-bb-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BB 2024 Q3","e":"bb","d":"2023-12-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steve Rai","x":"Non-GAAP operating expenses exclude a 13 million fair value gain on the convertible debentures, 11 million in impairment of long-lived assets, 9 million in amortization of acquired intangibles, 9 million in restructuring expenses, and 7 million in stock compensation expense.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/12/20/blackberry-bb-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BB 2024 Q4","e":"bb","d":"2024-04-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steve Rai","x":"Non-GAAP operating expenses exclude a 35 million goodwill impairment charge, 20 million of restructuring expenses, 8 million in amortization of acquired intangibles, 5 million in stock compensation expense, and 4 million in impairment of long-lived assets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/04/03/blackberry-bb-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BB 2024 Q4","e":"bb","d":"2024-04-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John Giamatteo","x":"In regards to cost, you may recall that during Q3, we executed on approximately $50 million of run rate savings, predominantly within the cybersecurity business and including approximately 200 headcount reductions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/04/03/blackberry-bb-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BB 2025 Q2","e":"bb","d":"2024-09-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tim Foote","x":"And during September, we announced a number of further back-office head count reductions and facility closures as we continue to streamline operations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/09/26/blackberry-bb-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BB 2025 Q2","e":"bb","d":"2024-09-26","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Tim Foote","x":"For Cyber, we expect revenue for Q3 to be in the range of $86 million to $90 million, and we're reiterating the full-year guidance range at $350 million to $365 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/09/26/blackberry-bb-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BB 2025 Q3","e":"bb","d":"2024-12-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tim Foote","x":"The new management team maintains a close focus on cost control, and operating expenses this quarter remained broadly in line with Q2 at 101 million and significantly below the 130 million baseline for opex that we provided as a reference point prior to cost streamlining over the past year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/12/19/blackberry-bb-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BB 2025 Q4","e":"bb","d":"2025-04-02","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Tim Foote","x":"Given the recent tariff changes, and particularly automotive tariffs, like others in the industry, we're currently uncertain of the impact this could have on our business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/08/blackberry-bb-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BB 2025 Q4","e":"bb","d":"2025-04-02","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Tim Foote","x":"While we currently don't see that tariffs will directly impact our products and service, we do expect some indirect effects on BlackBerry due to impacts to our customers, including supply chains and macroeconomic demand, although these effects are currently difficult to model.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/08/blackberry-bb-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BB 2025 Q4","e":"bb","d":"2025-04-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tim Foote","x":"…accrued corporate income tax in Europe, the ongoing cash cost of restructured facilities that we have exited but the lease hasn't yet expired, as well as the tail end of severance costs from actions taken this past year, particularly in international locations where the process takes longer.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/08/blackberry-bb-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BB 2025 Q4","e":"bb","d":"2025-04-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"John Giamatteo","x":"The cost reduction actions of the past quarter build on others that we've executed over the past year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/08/blackberry-bb-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BB 2026 Q1","e":"bb","d":"2025-06-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"John Giamatteo","x":"This represents 8% year over year growth despite the uncertainty facing the auto market, including the impact of various tariff announcements.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/06/24/blackberry-bb-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BB 2026 Q1","e":"bb","d":"2025-06-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"John Giamatteo","x":"While we have not seen any direct impacts from the automotive tariffs, there have been some delays to customer buying decisions due to this macro uncertainty.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/06/24/blackberry-bb-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BB 2026 Q1","e":"bb","d":"2025-06-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tim Foote","x":"This includes approximately $11 million of cash relating to restructuring costs, including $6 million of employee severance, and $5 million for lease payments for properties that we have exited.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/06/24/blackberry-bb-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BB 2026 Q1","e":"bb","d":"2025-06-24","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Tim Foote","x":"For licensing, we reiterate our guidance for revenue to be approximately $6 million, and adjusted EBITDA to be approximately $5 million per quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/06/24/blackberry-bb-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BB 2026 Q1","e":"bb","d":"2025-06-24","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Tim Foote","x":"Given the increased guidance for both secure communications revenue and adjusted EBITDA, we are raising guidance for the total company as well.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/06/24/blackberry-bb-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BB 2026 Q4","e":"bb","d":"2026-04-09","l":"ai_disruption","r":"analyst","s":"John Giamatteo","x":"This moat is multilayered and importantly, addresses the concerns investors have today about AI and software models.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/06/02/blackberry-bb-q4-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BB 2027 Q2","e":"bb","d":"2026-09-24","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Tim Foote","x":"The increased outlook reflects the strength and trajectory we continue to see across the business, while maintaining an appropriate level of flexibility for normal quarter to quarter variability.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/09/24/blackberry-bb-q2-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BB 2027 Q2","e":"bb","d":"2026-09-24","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Tim Foote","x":"For revenue, we are increasing guidance by $9 million at the midpoint to $616 to $636 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/09/24/blackberry-bb-q2-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[32,1,6921,0,0,0,5503,817],[33,1,5897,0,0,0,4600,922],[34,1,6380,0,0,0,5615,320],[35,1,5917,0,0,0,5127,323],[36,1,6228,0,0,0,5346,388],[39,1,5668,0,0,0,5308,0],[40,1,7222,0,0,0,1053,5846],[41,1,7365,0,0,0,6063,906],[42,1,5784,0,0,0,5306,131],[43,1,6025,0,0,0,5644,0],[44,1,7363,0,0,0,6956,0],[45,1,6293,0,0,0,5934,0],[46,1,6782,0,0,0,6320,124],[47,1,4944,0,0,0,4659,0],[48,1,5020,0,0,0,4771,0],[49,1,4754,0,0,0,4435,0],[50,1,6242,0,0,0,5591,309],[51,1,5779,0,0,0,5428,0],[53,1